              "value": "Change Shape"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, occult, polymorph, transmutation)\n\nThe raktavarna takes on the appearance of a Tiny inanimate object. If, while transformed, the raktavarna takes any action other than the purely mental (such as Recall Knowledge), they immediately revert to their original form.\n\nUntil then, they can use Deception to Impersonate the object."
